昆，自非殊功異德，無以允應茲典。大者道勳光遠<ref>'''大者道勳光遠：'''「勳」各本並作「動」，據{{WavyBookMark|元龜}}四七一改。</ref>，世所宗推；其次節行高妙，遺烈可紀。若乃亮采登庸，績用顯著，敷化所蒞，惠訓融遠，述詠所寄，有賴鐫勒，非斯族也，則-{幾}-乎僭黷矣。俗敝僞興，華煩已久，是以{{ProperNoun|孔悝}}之銘，行是人非；{{ProperNoun|蔡邕}}制文，每有愧色。而自時厥-{後}-，其流彌多，預有臣吏，必爲建立，勒銘寡取信之實，刊石成虛僞之常，真假相蒙，殆使合美者不貴，但論其功費，又不可稱。不加禁裁，其敝無已。」以爲「諸欲立碑者，宜悉令言上，爲朝議所許，然-{後}--{聽}-之。庶可以防遏無-{徵}-，顯彰茂實，使百世之下，知其不虛，則義信-{於}-仰止，道孚-{於}-來-{葉}-。」由是並斷<ref>'''並斷：'''{{WavyBookMark|南史}}作「普斷」。</ref>。","raw_path":"sources/songshu/wikisource-1748217-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p002","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳裴松之字世期、注陳壽三國志及子駰；既有宋053中書侍郎裴松之與梁030曾祖松之太中大夫脈絡相符，重用同人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p002:m0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"孔悝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"碑銘引古孔悝；當前ga6衛孔氏悝與r2r弟子候選尚待合證，不另造第三canonical。","candidate_person_ids":["ga6_jt5_6g1_A","r2r_byo_ezj"]},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p002:m0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"蔡邕","kind":"person","person_id":"gs5_qqu_9ui","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"碑銘撰文引古蔡邕，當前全label/alias無同名canonical；發來源局部身份，非憑百科定傳記。"}],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi","book_id":"b-songshu-064","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-song064-ws1748217"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-064","source_id":"s-song064-ws1748217","source":{"title":"宋書/卷64","revision_id":1748217,"revision_timestamp":"2019-10-16T05:46:10Z","status":200,"response_sha256":"010f6b9a277c33ab190dfbea81673926e2b637f8765888cda9d19361df936141","raw_sha256":"aeb7f890fb1a261a285786bd19844cbc090dc96e35d7ca61cf8ca1eadf66afb8","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B764&oldid=1748217","api_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=query&format=json&formatversion=2&prop=revi